  "title": "Twenty Minute Lasagna",
  "description": "A blend of spaghetti sauce mix, mushroom gravy mix, tomato paste and water is simmered with ground beef. Uncooked lasagna noodles are layered with the sauce and mozzarella cheese. The meal is ready in no time!",
  "authors": [
